{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"TokensProvider Implementations","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"role":"collectionGroup"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/tokensprovider-implementations"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of quantity input"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"code":"OUDSQuantityInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"code":"AllQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"code":"